			"color":"#322",
			"widgets_values":[
				1,
				"ID_A is Ethan Cole, a late-twenties American lifestyle vlogger with wavy brown hair, light stubble, tired blue eyes, and an approachable but increasingly uneasy screen presence. ID_A wears a faded denim jacket over a gray T-shirt, dark jeans, white sneakers, and carries a black smartphone with a opaque phone case on a compact handheld gimbal. ID_A's voice is a casual young male voice with warm tone, quick pacing, and a nervous brightness that becomes sharper under pressure. At normal speed, ID_A is Ethan Cole, ID_A walks past the same coffee shop he films every morning, smiling to his phone. ID_A's voice is a casual young male voice with warm tone, quick pacing, and a nervous brightness that becomes sharper under pressure. ID_A says: \\\"Morning, everyone. Same street, same coffee, same life. Somehow you still keep watching.\\\" Realistic live-action modern thriller with natural morning light, grounded performances, and subtle phone-video realism. Handheld selfie-style framing follows ID_A. A sunny Los Angeles sidewalk with a coffee shop, parked cars, palm shadows, and morning commuters. Traffic hum, phone recording beep, footsteps, distant espresso machine. Light electronic vlog music plays softly, slightly too polished for the casual scene.",
				"{\"prompts\": [\"ID_A is a thirty-year-old East Asian woman with a slender figure, delicate features, and her hair styled in an elegant updo, wearing a simple muted-colored cheongsam; she smiles softly with a restrained warmth. At normal speed, she holds a smartphone in her hand, adjusts the angle to frame herself, tilts her head slightly to the side, and lets a quiet, self-amused chuckle escape her lips. The shot has a realistic life-movie aesthetic with soft natural lighting and a delicate, serene atmosphere reminiscent of a classical garden. A waist-up medium shot captures her from the side-rear, with the camera tracking her slight movement and occasionally cutting to a gentle facial close-up. The background features a corner of a Suzhou garden with white walls, dark tiled roofs, flower windows, and dappled spring sunlight filtering through bamboo shadows. Birdsong, the rustle of leaves, and a simulated camera shutter click are audible alongside a low-volume, gentle guzheng melody that supports the quiet mood. ID_A's voice is soft, natural, and airy; her mouth movements are clearly visible and naturally synchronized with the spoken line. In a soft, natural tone, ID_A says, \\\"The light is just right today.\\\"\"]}",
				""
